OL,5,G0100 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FA Tactical Pursuit and Containment
OL,8,     F(TPAC) operation is in full swing
OL,9,     Fas a vehicle linked to drug
OL,10,     Fdealing is on the run and evading
OL,11,     Fpolice.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FDuring a busy shift in Resus, a
OL,14,     F58-year-old woman arrives by
OL,15,     Fambulance with a dangerously fast
OL,16,     Fheart rate, and a patient comes in
OL,17,     Ffollowing a suspected drug
OL,18,     Foverdose.
